    "source": "/** 0-1 knapsack brute force — complete Java reference. */\npublic final class KnapsackBrute {\n    public static long knapsackBrute(int[] weights, long[] values, int W) {\n        int n = weights.length;\n        long best = 0;\n        long total = 1L << n;\n        for (long mask = 0; mask < total; mask++) {\n            long wt = 0;\n            long val = 0;\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                if ((mask & (1L << i)) != 0) {\n                    wt += weights[i];\n                    val += values[i];\n                }\n            }\n            if (wt <= W && val > best) best = val;\n        }\n        return best;\n    }\n}\n",
